// Owning domain  : Content Creation (chora_creation)
// Owning team    : Team 1 (Content)
// Topic prefix   : chora.creation.ai_assist.*
// Surface (admin): A+ Creator mode
//
// Subscribers:
//   - chora-creation       — state-update (write AI Assist invocation row;
//                            on completed/refused, update author projection)
//   - chora-observability  — D1 accountability evidence; D3 safety evidence
